title: Party Discipline
subtitle: You hold the Zentrale. Use it against your rivals.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
view-if: rf_discipline_timer <= 0 and player_leads = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_discipline_timer = 3

= Party Discipline

The leadership controls appointments, the paper and the party's money. The statutes allow it to remove functionaries who break discipline, and to expel members.

- @warn: Issue a formal warning to all factions.
- @remove_right: Remove Right functionaries from their posts.
- @remove_left: Remove Left functionaries from their posts.
- @remove_center: Remove Middle Group functionaries from their posts.
- @remove_stalin: Remove Thälmann's people from their posts.
- @expel: Expel the most rebellious faction's leaders.

@warn
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 3;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) {
    if (f != Q.player) { Q[f + '_dissent'] += 3; }
}
!}

The Zentrale warns that factional work will be punished. The factions take note and go on.

@remove_right
view-if: player != "right" and right_expelled = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 4;
Q.members -= 4;
Q.right_dissent += 12;
window.RF.shift(Q, 'right', Q.player, 6);
!}

Brandler's supporters lose their editorships and district posts.

@remove_left
view-if: player != "left" and left_expelled = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 4;
Q.members -= 4;
Q.left_dissent += 12;
window.RF.shift(Q, 'left', Q.player, 6);
!}

Left functionaries in Berlin and Hamburg are replaced by reliable people.

@remove_center
view-if: player != "center" and center_expelled = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 4;
Q.members -= 3;
Q.center_dissent += 12;
window.RF.shift(Q, 'center', Q.player, 5);
!}

The Middle Group loses its seats on the party commissions.

@remove_stalin
view-if: player != "stalin" and stalin_expelled = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 4;
Q.members -= 3;
Q.stalin_dissent += 12;
window.RF.shift(Q, 'stalin', Q.player, 5);
!}

Thälmann's Hamburg allies are moved out of their posts.

@expel
choose-if: (player != "right" and right_dissent >= 50 and right_expelled = 0) or (player != "left" and left_dissent >= 50 and left_expelled = 0) or (player != "center" and center_dissent >= 50 and center_expelled = 0) or (player != "stalin" and stalin_dissent >= 50 and stalin_expelled = 0)
unavailable-subtitle: No rival faction is rebellious enough to justify expulsion (dissent 50 or more).
on-arrival: {!
var target = null;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) {
    if (f != Q.player && !Q[f + '_expelled'] && (target === null || Q[f + '_dissent'] > Q[target + '_dissent'])) {
        target = f;
    }
}
Q.expelled_name = window.RF.names[target];
Q.members -= Math.round(Q[target + '_strength'] * 1.2);
Q.union_influence -= 5;
Q.apparatus += 8;
Q[target + '_expelled'] = 1;
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] -= 5;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

The leaders of the [+ expelled_name +] are expelled for factional activity. Many of their followers leave with them. The party is more obedient and smaller. Moscow asks why it was not consulted.
